; The Epilogue VPlan's loop is modified in-place: its IV start is shifted
; back so the last iter ends at TC (when main ran), and its exit is
; changed to TC. The main-skipped path keeps standard start (0) and
; standard exit (n.vec_epi). Selects pick the right values at runtime
; (in the preheader, amortized over all loop iters); the loop body is
; unchanged.
;
; Main VF=16, epi VF=8. Realign fires on the EPI VPlan (VF_epi=8 >=
; min-vf-lanes=8); main VPlan during epi-vec is not modified (its tail
; goes to the EPI VPlan).
